        "description": "<p><strong>What it does (SRD):</strong> <strong>Scent</strong> lets the creature detect opponents by smell, usually out to about <strong>30 ft.</strong> (strong scents farther, very weak scents closer). It can use scent to <strong>pinpoint</strong> a square once it is within 5 ft., and to <strong>track</strong> by Survival. Wind and water affect what it can smell.</p><p><strong>ThirdEra:</strong> Scent (<strong>30 ft.</strong>) is set on this item’s <strong>Details</strong> tab under <strong>Capability grants</strong> (vision and senses), not in <strong>Mechanical effects</strong>. The character sheet includes it with other senses; Survival checks to track by scent still use the normal skill rules unless you add separate bonuses elsewhere.</p>",
